<title>USA: Warner-Lambert sues Hoechst in patent dispute.</title>
<headline>Warner-Lambert sues Hoechst in patent dispute.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Warner-Lambert Co has filed a lawsuit against Hoechst AG in an effort to ward off an expected patent-infringement suit from the German pharmaceuticals company.</p>
<p>In papers filed this week in the U.S. District Court in Delaware, Warner-Lambert alleges that in one and a half years of negotiations with Hoechst over two disputed patents, &quot;it has been Hoechst's view that...Warner-Lambert should agree to a license because litigation is risky.&quot;</p>
</text>
